        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Batu Caves</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed">A series of limestone caves and cave temples featuring a 43-meter golden statue of Lord Murugan.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-md hover:shadow-xl transition duration-300">
